          <rules>
            <rule name="Scion of the Dreadwing" id="5ce2-e9bb-3ed3-3013" hidden="false">
              <description>An Infantry model with this special rule and any Infantry unit it joins with the Legion Astartes (Dark Angels) special rule may choose to move 4&quot; through difficult terrain rather than rolling any dice and may re-roll failed Dangerous Terrain tests.</description>
